{"id":"c79336c0ca9ddde8","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-structure.md","title":"Structure","display":"df-structure — Structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-structure","aliases":["93-df-structure"],"display":"df-structure — Structure","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-structure — Structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is a candidate similarity type and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> is a structure candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_{93}\\)</span> is the book-local name defined here and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\\mathrm{Struct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\\mathrm{Struct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is an exact local alias for algebraic structures; <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a> already validates and binds both components of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_{93}$ is the book-local name defined here and $\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is from [[93-df-algebra]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"This is an exact local alias for algebraic structures; [[93-df-algebra]] already validates and binds both components of $\\tau$.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}structure}\\vdash\\mathrm{Struct}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathfrak A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false}],"bytes":730,"backlinks":[{"id":"0ce709e0d2857990","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-structure]] remains the operation-only algebraic notion. This atom adds genuine relation interpretations and explicit family projections; reducts are formed by graph restriction rather than prose-indexed component tuples."},{"id":"57abb955e28f83aa","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[93-df-structure]]"}],"outgoing":["6730349967b8ffce"]}